  console.log('Stream ended');
});
```

In this example, we create a custom stream class called `MyPullStream` that extends the `Readable` class. The `_read()` method is overridden to provide the logic for pulling data from the stream. In this case, we simply push each element of the `data` array as a chunk of data until all elements have been pushed.

When you run this code, it will output the following:

