1. Install Npcap: Download and install the latest version of Npcap from https://nmap.org/npcap/. Make sure to select the "Install as a service" option during installation.

2. Create a new C++ project in Visual Studio or any other IDE of your choice.

3. Include the necessary headers for Npcap:
```cpp
